--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f670f815c51170442b47b92f4a03f3f7, type: 3}
  m_Name: L3_HaleConfession
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  id: L3_HaleConfession
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4a5171808e189648a6c629a843d67e0, type: 2}
    text: You've been straight with me since the first morning. So I'll be straight
      with you.
    conditions:
    - type: 2
      key: trust
      intValue: 4
      textValue: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4a5171808e189648a6c629a843d67e0, type: 2}
    text: I don't trust you, Jay. But you're all I have left tonight.
    conditions:
    - type: 3
      key: trust
      intValue: 2
      textValue: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4a5171808e189648a6c629a843d67e0, type: 2}
    text: You read them. Of course you read them. I would have.
    conditions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4a5171808e189648a6c629a843d67e0, type: 2}
    text: Corvane. Eleven years ago a reactor line failed. A young engineer made
      the mistake. I signed the report that said it was mine.
    conditions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4a5171808e189648a6c629a843d67e0, type: 2}
    text: They took my licence and gave me a settlement I could never pay. Paul bought
      my debt. I have been paying him in cartons ever since.
    conditions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4a5171808e189648a6c629a843d67e0, type: 2}
    text: You kept things quiet with Luka. I thought that meant you understood. It
      means you are good at this. That frightens me.
    conditions:
    - type: 4
      key: lukaDeal
      intValue: 0
      textValue: accepted
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4a5171808e189648a6c629a843d67e0, type: 2}
    text: And yesterday you squeezed his collector for an extra hundred. Paul doesn't
      forget a hundred dollars, Jay. He doesn't forget anything.
    conditions:
    - type: 4
      key: lukaDeal
      intValue: 0
      textValue: pushed
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4a5171808e189648a6c629a843d67e0, type: 2}
    text: And yesterday you said no to Luka. I hired you so there would be someone
      between Paul and me. I never meant it to be someone braver than me.
    conditions:
    - type: 4
      key: lukaDeal
      intValue: 0
      textValue: refused
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 37fb9708d40dec141b361114c996e24e, type: 2}
    text: So why did you hire me?
    conditions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4a5171808e189648a6c629a843d67e0, type: 2}
    text: Because tonight's order goes out in person. Paul is coming himself.
    conditions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4a5171808e189648a6c629a843d67e0, type: 2}
    text: Seal it. Carry it. Be polite. Then go home and forget his face.
    conditions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4a5171808e189648a6c629a843d67e0, type: 2}
    text: And take this. A hundred, for your rent. Don't argue with me.
    conditions:
    - type: 2
      key: trust
      intValue: 4
      textValue: 
  choices:
  - text: Take Hale's $100.
    conditions:
    - type: 2
      key: trust
      intValue: 4
      textValue: 
    effects:
    - type: 2
      key: cash
      intValue: 100
      textValue: 
    - type: 0
      key: haleGift
      intValue: 0
      textValue: 
    loopAction: 0
    payment: 0
    next: {fileID: 0}
  - text: '"Keep it. You''ll need it more than me."'
    conditions:
    - type: 2
      key: trust
      intValue: 4
      textValue: 
    effects: []
    loopAction: 0
    payment: 0
    next: {fileID: 0}
  onComplete:
  - type: 0
    key: confessionHeard
    intValue: 0
    textValue: 
  loopActionOnComplete: 1
  playOnce: 1
